anonzerg.github.io

Plain html blog.

  index.html                    home page
  about.html                    about me
  posts/index.html              all posts
  posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.html    actual post
  build.py                      creates posts, regenerates the post lists

Adding a post:
  1. ./build.py --create-post --title 'title'
       (date defaults to today; optional: --date YYYY-MM-DD, --slug name)
  2. edit the body of the new file in posts/
  3. ./build.py --build
  4. git add, commit, push

Local preview:
  python -m http.server 8080
